{"seq":3,"slug":"building-technology","title":"建筑技术与结构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/architecture/building-technology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"structural-systems","title":"结构体系","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/architecture/building-technology/structural-systems","wordCount":1420,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"building-materials","title":"建筑材料","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/architecture/building-technology/building-materials","wordCount":1471,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"building-physics-and-environment","title":"建筑物理与环境控制","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/architecture/building-technology/building-physics-and-environment","wordCount":1366,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"建筑技术与结构\">建筑技术与结构</h1><p>再优美的方案，也必须能站立、能遮风挡雨、能让身处其中的人感到舒适。本章把视角从纸面拉回物理世界，讲解支撑建筑的工程逻辑：结构如何把荷载安全地导入大地，材料各有什么脾性，建筑又如何调控声、光、热这些看不见的环境要素。</p>\n<p>本章分三课。第一课讲结构体系——梁柱、拱、桁架、框架如何传力；第二课讲建筑材料，从石头、砖木到混凝土、钢与玻璃的演变与特性；第三课讲建筑物理与环境控制，理解保温、采光、隔声与节能的基本原理。</p>\n"}